      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WORKFLOW 11 — Teacher Approval\n\nEl borrador NUNCA se convierte automáticamente en acta final. Este workflow expone un Webhook para que el frontend consulte/actualice el estado de revisión: awaiting_teacher_review -> (aprobado | editado | rechazado). Solo tras la aprobación explícita se marca teacher_approved = true.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "44huelnkrkgl0d8q",
      "name": "Nota - kqdh",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "acta-pro/teacher-review",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "r6r2dcedrcmwdebo",
      "name": "Webhook /teacher-review",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = items[0].json.body || items[0].json;\nconst decision = b.decision; // 'approve' | 'edit' | 'reject'\nconst result = {\n  meeting_id: b.meeting_id,\n  decision,\n  edited_content: b.edited_content || null,\n  teacher_approved: decision === 'approve',\n  status: decision === 'approve' ? 'teacher_approved' : (decision === 'edit' ? 'awaiting_teacher_review' : 'rejected'),\n  reviewed_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n};\nreturn [{ json: result }];"
      },
      "id": "v7xiyhona6dopepg",
